Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead’s got a nice little\Nbeach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,window today, Saturday\NNovember 21st.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Preston Beach looks best from\N11:30
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,AM to 3:30 PM, with sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,skies, around 61 degrees, and\Nwind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,at 5 mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tide is the star here:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,2:10 PM at 0.5 ft, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,tide pools and a low-tide\Nwander
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,are very much on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,High tides are 7:53 AM and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,8:21 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring a layer, and maybe shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you don’t mind getting nosy\Nin.
